{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/21db23563995e641781f444ddd094e5154485dddb3c09f128a695db6fb24de1b4345c63c5313ed82bc3790a3d0fa9c6c752ba46c83f818a39a940cf2b3a512f5","height":929,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/iH5mSTXtDMA3gH_rJyr6UiHkYvsrKnEFkacVljhxePXwUUjZg9D79sazDXKNVW0rGqQ3EpCV5P9FStdE9usTzywImtCa6flGvr_48woZync_Vr-BWnk","width":929},"name":"Euphrates Dahout","title":"Material Systems Design Lead"},"document_id":4686288468574208,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p><em>Tabula rasa</em>（白板）&ndash; 一片空白&hellip;&hellip;听起来很棒，对吧？有时，一张崭新而空白的 Figma 画板让人感觉充满机会，但有时它也会让人觉得太空了。</p>\n<p>在设计团队中，创造力是共享的、依托语境的。我们尝试各种形态、字体和颜色；我们汲取周围的想法与素材，并在其上层层构建。</p>\n<p><strong>借助 M3 设计套件，UX 构建模块可以在你的 Figma 工作流中即取即用、随心定制。 </strong>有了预先制作好的 UI 元素，以及相互关联的组件和样式库，你就可以站在 Material 3 最新成果的基础之上进行构建。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.figma.com/community/file/1035203688168086460\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Figma 中查看新的设计套件并复制一份，开始在你的文件中使用 M3</a>。</p>\n<h2>不只是组件贴纸集</h2>\n<p>&lt;mio-video index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-video&gt;</p>\n<p>M3 设计套件里有什么？从今天起，你将获得&hellip;&hellip;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>28 个 UI 组件</li>\n<li>共 169 个 Figma 组件</li>\n<li>1,984 个变体</li>\n<li>429 个样式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>而且设计套件仍在持续扩充 &ndash; 它始终保持最新，并与 Material.io 上的设计指南保持同步。</p>\n<p>除了组件、变体和交互状态之外，M3 设计套件还让你能够<strong>检查元素</strong>并<strong>应用语义化颜色角色</strong>。设计套件中的颜色角色与 <a href=\"https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1034969338659738588/Material-Theme-Builder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Material Theme Builder</a> 兼容，因此你可以轻松地将自定义配色方案整合到 Figma 工作流中。</p>\n<h2>工作原理</h2>\n<p>新的设计套件<strong>使用了 Figma 最先进的功能</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; 我们添加了元数据，可显示无障碍信息、颜色值、令牌名称、丰富的变体以及交互状态细节。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>开始使用</h2>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>要开始使用，请访问 Material Design 社区页面：在 Material Design 3 设计套件中，选择 <strong>Get a copy（获取副本）</strong>。</p>\n<p>你将获得该文件、组件和样式的副本，即可开始在 Figma 中使用。将文件发布为库，让你和你的团队都能通过资源（Assets）标签页使用这套设计套件。</p>\n<p><strong>告诉我们你的想法！</strong></p>\n<p>M3 设计套件凝聚了许多心血、匠心与专业知识 &ndash; 我们希望你试用一下，并向团队反馈意见。设计套件的 Figma Community 页面包含更新日志和更多支持详情；你也可以通过 Twitter 与我们联系。</p>\n<p>最后同样重要的是&hellip;&hellip;<strong>感谢 Material 设计系统团队的每一位成员</strong>共同贡献并打造出这套设计套件。</p>\n<p></p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"A time picker component and its variants can be viewed alongside the inspection panel, which shows the selected region’s color role.","bordered":false,"caption":"Inspect elements to identify Material component specs within your Figma workflow","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/d9c0933587163052b6baad12a4ce1818974371ebf4eb189235fed3bbcb3996e73982fc4804554be38bd239ecce8349010fd63a5a0dee570c3f797205b3f35b64","height":1557,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/KiYkMv-Cyvi80oHQbYORznWWfaAx8mKtZye6OIgmCvAu-VpZUspSvKxi8GgEITK0O-YdYJRadEN6PBkjMxCG2jgzyAERZ-qQYoy8TEaJex2Ef91MEB4","width":2865}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"To start using the design kit, visit the Figma Community page for Material 3 Design Kit and select Get a copy.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/7dfd25f514cca45c67d45783399fa0b628c74a3504eb947075ac78fc331672fa87e76b9307a9e135078047f072c1cfdd4da7ae4c7e4b116de50dfb946233f367","height":1237,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/dK1tZdUUt-VXxIcZU6_pQWTPwIVr7L7JhlAKJPqBdsGsbzxF6UlDtQPtQD9og7iGFCTZlXbcwHD8HRWiG-kLcwgISCPPoKV5ciGeDcASp61EJ-aa3g","width":2730}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[{"a11y_description":null,"autoplay":false,"bordered":false,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_name":"designkitvideo.mp4","file_path":"214a5b34165de6792cc60e8f0ec9ab299ba0caea5c470069f7d6e1a8658ec2363295ff299393f4e082f25b433fc27a92dcbeeb2612cadcd7832cc9c3faeb236c","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/material-io-